{"unit_id": "tag:01OU:title", "translation": "诺特（Noetherian）概形（schemes）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "节标题中的概形性质"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "节标题所指的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OU:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，称环（ring）<MATH_0001>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>诺特（Noetherian）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，如果它满足升链条件（ascending chain condition）（就理想（ideals）而言）。等价地，<MATH_0002>的每个理想（ideal）都是有限生成（finitely generated）的。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "ascending chain condition", "target_term": "升链条件"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "该性质所适用的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "由升链条件刻画的环性质"}, {"source_term": "ascending chain condition", "target_term": "升链条件", "context": "对理想的升链所施加的条件"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想", "context": "升链条件所涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "等价表述中逐个考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成", "context": "等价表述中要求理想具有的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OV:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部诺特（locally Noetherian）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，如果每个<MATH_0003>都有一个仿射开（affine open）邻域<MATH_0004>，使得环（ring）<MATH_0005>是诺特（Noetherian）的。\n<STRUCT_0003>称<MATH_0006>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>诺特（Noetherian）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的，如果<MATH_0007>既是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的，又是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义适用的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "由逐点的仿射开邻域定义的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "对邻域的要求"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "在邻域上考察的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "邻域所对应的环须有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "第二项所定义的概形性质"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "第二项要求的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "第二项要求的整体性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OU:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面是刻画局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（schemes）的标准结果。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "下述结果所刻画的性质"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "下述结果所考察的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OW:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的。\n<STRUCT_0003>对于每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0003>，环（ring）<MATH_0004>都是诺特（Noetherian）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>存在一个仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得每个<MATH_0006>都是诺特（Noetherian）的。\n<STRUCT_0005>存在一个开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，使得每个开子概形<MATH_0008>都是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n此外，如果<MATH_0009>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的，那么其每个开子概形都是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "各条件之间的逻辑关系"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "第一项中的概形性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第二项中逐一考察的开集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "第二项中逐一考察的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "第二项所要求的环性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "第三项对覆盖成员的限制"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第三项中要求存在的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "第三项要求每个相应对象具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第四项中的覆盖，原文以 open 修饰"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "第四项所要求的开子概形性质"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "附加断言的假设"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "附加断言中开子概形所得的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OW:proof", "translation": "要证明这一点，只须证明诺特（Noetherian）性是环（rings）的局部性质，见引理<REF_0001>。\n任一局部化（localization），只要是取自诺特环（Noetherian ring），就是诺特（Noetherian）的，见《代数学（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>。\n由《代数学（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>可见，定义<REF_0004>中的第二个性质成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "要证明其为局部性质的环性质"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "局部性质所适用的对象"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化", "context": "所用的环构造"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环", "context": "施行局部化的原环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "局部化所得环的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学", "context": "局部化结论的引用章节"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学", "context": "验证第二个性质的引用章节"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OX:statement", "translation": "任意浸入（immersion）<MATH_0001>，只要<MATH_0002>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的，就是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "引理考察的一类态射"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "引理中的假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "浸入所得的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OX:proof", "translation": "闭浸入（closed immersion）显然是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n复合（composition）若由拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphisms）构成，则也是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，见《拓扑学（Topology）》引理<REF_0001>。\n因此只须证明，开浸入（open immersion）的目标若为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme），则该开浸入是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n由《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>，可归约到<MATH_0001>是仿射（affine）的情形。\n任一开子集（open subset），若取自诺特环（Noetherian ring）的谱，就是拟紧（quasi-compact）的（例如结合《代数学（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>与《拓扑学（Topology）》引理<REF_0004>和<REF_0005>）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "先行处理的一类浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "闭浸入具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "把态射结合起来的运算"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "参与复合的态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "复合所得态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "复合性质的引用章节"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "余下待处理的一类浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "开浸入的目标所具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "开浸入的目标"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "余下要为开浸入证明的性质"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "归约到仿射情形的引用章节"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "归约后的条件"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "在谱中考察的子集"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环", "context": "取谱的环"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "上述开子集具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学", "context": "关于谱的结论所引用的章节"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "关于开子集的结论所引用的章节"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OY:statement", "translation": "局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）是拟分离（quasi-separated）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "引理的概形假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "引理所得的概形性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OY:proof", "translation": "由《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>，我们只需证明交集<MATH_0001>（取自两个仿射开集（affine opens）的交，这两个开集都在<MATH_0002>中）是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。由上面的引理<REF_0002>即可得出这一结论，例如考虑开浸入（open immersion）<MATH_0003>。\n（不过，这实际上只是因为诺特环（Noetherian ring）的谱的任一开集都是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。）\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "将结论化为交集拟紧性的引用章节"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "取交集的两个开集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "要证明交集具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "应用上一引理时所考察的态射"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环", "context": "末句中取谱的环"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "谱的任意开集所具有的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OZ:statement", "translation": "（局部）诺特概形（Noetherian scheme）的底层空间是（局部）诺特（Noetherian）拓扑空间（topological space），见《拓扑学（Topology）》定义<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形", "context": "引理所考察的概形，原文含可选的局部限定"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "结论中底层空间的性质，原文含可选的局部限定"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "考察概形的底层空间时所在的范畴"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "引用该性质定义的章节"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OZ:proof", "translation": "这是因为诺特概形（Noetherian scheme）是有限（finite）多个谱的并，这些谱取自诺特（Noetherian）环（rings），再应用《代数学（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>和《拓扑学（Topology）》引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形", "context": "证明中分解为谱的并的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "对并的项数的限制"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "各谱对应的环的性质"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "取谱的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学", "context": "论证所用的第一条引理的章节"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "论证所用的第二条引理的章节"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IK:statement", "translation": "任一局部闭子概形（closed subscheme），若取自（局部）诺特概形（Noetherian scheme），就是（局部）诺特（Noetherian）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "原文以 locally 限定所考察的子概形"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形", "context": "子概形所属的概形，原文含可选的局部限定"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "子概形继承的性质，原文含可选的局部限定"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IK:proof", "translation": "略。提示：任一商（quotient）或局部化（localization），只要取自诺特环（Noetherian ring），就是诺特（Noetherian）的。对于诺特（Noetherian）情形，再次利用如下事实：任一子集（subset），只要属于一个诺特（Noetherian）空间，就是一个诺特（Noetherian）空间（赋予诱导拓扑（topology））。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商", "context": "第一条提示涉及的环构造"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化", "context": "第一条提示涉及的另一环构造"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环", "context": "取商或局部化的原环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "上述构造所得环的性质"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "第二条提示所处理的情形"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集", "context": "第二条提示中任取的对象"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "子集所在空间的性质"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "子集继承的空间性质"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "子集所赋予的诱导结构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BA8:statement", "translation": "诺特概形（Noetherian scheme）有有限（finite）多个不可约分支（irreducible components）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形", "context": "引理所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "引理对分支个数的断言"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "引理中所计数的分支"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BA8:proof", "translation": "底层拓扑空间（topological space）若来自诺特概形（Noetherian scheme），便是诺特（Noetherian）的（引理<REF_0001>）。由于诺特（Noetherian）拓扑空间（topological space）只有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components）（《拓扑学（Topology）》引理<REF_0002>），结论即得。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "概形的底层空间"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形", "context": "底层空间所对应的概形"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "底层空间具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "应用拓扑学引理所需的性质"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "拓扑学引理考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "所要证明个数有限的分支"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "分支个数有限的结论所引章节"}], "notes": []}
