{"unit_id": "tag:01P0:proof", "translation": "应用引理<REF_0001>，并利用如下事实：任一子集（subset），只要属于一个诺特（Noetherian）拓扑空间（topological space），就是拟紧（quasi-compact）的（见《拓扑学（Topology）》引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集", "context": "所用事实中任取的对象"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "子集所在空间的性质"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "子集所在的空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "所用事实断言子集具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "所用事实的引用章节"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OU:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面是一个有趣的引理。\n它指出，每个局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）都有很多闭点（每个闭子集（closed subset）中至少有一个）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "引理所考察的概形的性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理讨论其闭点的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "闭点至少出现一个的范围"}], "notes": []}
