{"unit_id": "tag:02IL:proof", "translation": "第二个断言由第一个断言推出（应用《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>和引理<REF_0002>）。\n考虑任一非空（nonempty）的仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0001>。\n设<MATH_0002>为一个闭点。如果<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的闭点，证明即告完成。否则，设<MATH_0005>为<MATH_0006>上的诱导的既约（reduced）闭子概形（closed subscheme）结构。\n此时，<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>的一个仿射开集（affine open），这是由《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0003>及<MATH_0009>得到的。设<MATH_0010>，且<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>的一个特化。\n考虑局部环（local ring）<MATH_0013>。\n这是一个诺特局部环（Noetherian local ring），因为<MATH_0014>是诺特（Noetherian）的，这由引理<REF_0004>可知。记<MATH_0015>为<MATH_0016>在<MATH_0017>中的逆（inverse）像（image），这里使用的是典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0018>（见《概形（Schemes）》第<REF_0005>节）。\n按构造，<MATH_0019>是单点集（singleton），其中唯一的点对应于<MATH_0020>（应用《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0006>）。\n由《代数学（Algebra）》引理<REF_0007>可知<MATH_0021>。\n换言之，<MATH_0022>是<MATH_0023>的直接特化（见《拓扑学（Topology）》定义<REF_0008>）。\n也就是说，任取一点<MATH_0024>，若<MATH_0025>，它就是<MATH_0026>的直接特化。显然，其中每个点都是所求的闭点。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian local ring", "target_term": "诺特局部环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单点集"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "由第一个断言推出第二个断言的