{"unit_id": "tag:054F:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>中点的一个特化关系。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>存在离散赋值环（discrete valuation ring）<MATH_0004>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>，使得泛点<MATH_0006>（取自<MATH_0007>）映射（maps）到<MATH_0008>，特殊点映射（maps）到<MATH_0009>，并且\n<STRUCT_0003>若<MATH_0010>，给定有限生成（finitely generated）的域（field）扩张<MATH_0011>，可使扩张<MATH_0012>（由<MATH_0013>诱导）与给定的扩张同构（isomorphic）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "discrete valuation ring", "target_term": "离散赋值环"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "引理的概形假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "特化所处的对象"}, {"source_term": "discrete valuation ring", "target_term": "离散赋值环", "context": "第一项中断言存在的环"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项中断言存在的箭头"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "描述泛点的去向"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "描述特殊点的去向"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成", "context": "对给定扩张的限制"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "给定扩张涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "诱导扩张与给定扩张之间的关系"}], "notes": []}
