{"unit_id": "tag:01P4:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>是雅各布森的。\n<STRUCT_0003>概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>是“局部雅各布森”的，这里的含义由定义<REF_0001>给出。\n<STRUCT_0004>对于每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>，环（ring）<MATH_0005>都是雅各布森的。\n<STRUCT_0005>存在一个仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，使得每个<MATH_0007>都是雅各布森的。\n<STRUCT_0006>存在一个开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0008>，使得每个开子概形<MATH_0009>都是雅各布森的。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n此外，若<MATH_0010>是雅各布森的，则它的每个开子概形都是雅各布森的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "各条件之间的逻辑关系"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项中所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二项中所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第三项中逐一考察的开集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "第三项中逐一考察的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "第四项对覆盖成员的限制"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第四项中要求存在的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第五项中要求存在的开覆盖"}], "notes": []}
